    (property "Note" "Bootstrap diode -- the driver has none built in. Blocks VB, which rides 12 V above a bank node that reaches ~102 V: 200 V class. It charges whenever the bank node swings low: every hold off-time through D_fw, and between injections through the 100k bleed." (id 4) (at 616.0 208.0 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
